KernelSU kernel driver, imported unmodified from
https://github.com/tiann/KernelSU tag v3.3.1 (0c0fdb960178fa12d80d6cbcfdcb6ad8be6a865d),
directory kernel/, except for the version fallback in Kbuild (the tree is not
a KernelSU git repository, so the version is fixed to the official 32680).

Built in (CONFIG_KSU=y, the Kconfig default). Pair it with the official
KernelSU manager v3.3.1 (me.weishu.kernelsu).
